@startuml sequence-audio-capture
!include plantuml-style.puml
title Pi-coordinated capture with external analysis
hide footbox
autonumber

actor Operator
participant Browser
participant "Pi Rust API\nRun coordinator" as Pi
participant "Pi camera/microphone\nCapture" as Capture
participant "Wainlux K6" as Device
database "runs.jsonl" as Log
participant "External audio\nanalysis API" as Analyzer

Operator -> Browser: Review attempt and confirm run
Browser -> Pi: POST /api/run-check
Pi -> Capture: Start recording with pre-roll
Capture --> Pi: Ready + monotonic capture origin
Pi -> Log: Bind capture ID and attempt ID
Pi -> Device: Execute approved run
Device --> Pi: Status and receive events
Pi -> Capture: Stop after bounded post-run tail
Capture --> Pi: Recording + capture timing
Pi -> Log: Append outcome and capture metadata
Pi -> Analyzer: POST /analyses (audio + filtered events)
Analyzer --> Pi: analysis_id accepted

loop Until report is ready
  Pi -> Analyzer: GET /analyses/{analysis_id}
  Analyzer --> Pi: status + report reference
end

Browser -> Pi: GET /api/run-check/{attempt_id}
Pi --> Browser: Run outcome + logs + analysis status
Browser -> Pi: GET /api/analysis/{analysis_id}/report
Pi -> Analyzer: Fetch report and media
Analyzer --> Pi: Annotated HTML report
Pi --> Browser: Same-origin report response

alt Phone or independent capture source
  Browser -> Pi: Enable optional sync cue
  Pi --> Browser: Cue metadata + six-digit ID
end

note over Pi,Analyzer
  The analyzer has no laser-control credentials
  and cannot trigger a run.
  Upload failure leaves the recording pending
  for bounded retry on the Pi.
end note

@enduml